<section class="section alt"><div class="container grid-2"><div><p class="eyebrow">Process</p><h2>A guided path from first brief to finished launch.</h2><p class="lede">The workflow keeps strategy, content, design, assets, and implementation connected instead of scattering decisions across disconnected handoffs.</p></div><div class="process-list"><div class="process-item"><div><h3>Listen and map</h3><p>Document priorities, constraints, audience needs, and what success must feel like.</p></div></div><div class="process-item"><div><h3>Design and specify</h3><p>Turn the strategy into layouts, content structure, materials, and build-ready decisions.</p></div></div><div class="process-item"><div><h3>Build and refine</h3><p>Coordinate implementation, test the experience, and prepare long-term care notes.</p></div></div><div class="process-item"><div><h3>Prepare the next step</h3><p>Document the finished structure, contact paths, content priorities, and future update rhythm.</p></div></div></div></div></section>
